# Normalise line endings in the repository, and check out LF everywhere.
#
# Without this, Windows clones get CRLF and Linux clones get LF for the same file,
# which shows up as whole-file diffs between developers -- and, worse, a Dockerfile
# or shell script with CRLF fails inside the Alpine images with an unhelpful
# "not found" from the shebang line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only tooling; these never run inside a container.
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.slnx text eol=crlf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.nupkg binary
